OL,3,ACut national insurance for under-25s to
OL,4,Acreate jobs, Milburn report to say
OL,5,
OL,6,FNational Insurance (NI) paid by
OL,7,Fbusinesses on workers aged under 25
OL,8,Fshould be gradually lowered to
OL,9,Fencourage companies to create jobs for
OL,10,Fyoung people, a major review of youth
OL,11,Funemployment will say.
OL,13,FA report by former Labour minister Alan
OL,14,FMilburn will suggest the government
OL,15,Fshould reduce NI costs over five years
OL,16,Ffor people aged between 21 and 24 years
OL,17,Fold, starting in retail and
OL,18,Fhospitality.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
