OL,3,ASuspected China spy linked to Nvidia's
OL,4,Aex-boss left in 2025, Megaspeed says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlice Huang, a suspected China spy who
OL,7,Fhas been linked to Nvidia's former boss
OL,8,FJensen Huang, left her executive role
OL,9,Fat Megaspeed in August last year, the
OL,10,Fcompany says.
OL,12,FJensen Huang resigned as chief
OL,13,Fexecutive of the AI chip-making giant
OL,14,FNvidia after it emerged he had
OL,15,Fallegedly had affairs with Alice Huang
OL,16,Fas well as with one of his employees.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
