OL,3,ASouth Korea's top scorer in tax
OL,4,Aaccountancy exam admits cheating
OL,5,
OL,6,FA candidate who came first in South
OL,7,FKorea's certified tax accountancy exam
OL,8,Fhas admitted cheating by using a
OL,9,Fminiature camera, mobile phone and AI
OL,10,Ftools.
OL,12,FHan Won-seok confessed in a video on
OL,13,Fthe YouTube account of his lawyer, Lee
OL,14,FDon-Ho, adding that he had confessed to
OL,15,Fthe Seoul Metropolitan Police Agency
OL,16,Fand offered details on how he cheated.
OL,18,FThe 34-year-old scored 397.5 out of 400
OL,19,Fpoints in the first round, getting just
OL,20,Fone of 160 questions wrong, which
OL,21,Finitially raised suspicions and sparked
OL,22,Fonline speculation.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
